From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 18:03:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] hostaidls: Keep ICameraProvider in the container

Deckard's hosts have no Halium servicemanager. The entry routed every
ICameraProvider lookup and registration to /dev/host_binder, so the
container's own camera provider could not be found.
---
 hostaidls.conf | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/hostaidls.conf b/hostaidls.conf
index e5d9229..b50540b 100644
--- a/hostaidls.conf
+++ b/hostaidls.conf
@@ -5,5 +5,4 @@
 # Consumed by frameworks/native libbinder (host-AIDL passthrough patch),
 # loaded from /system/etc/hostaidls.conf.
 
-android.hardware.camera.provider.ICameraProvider
 android.hardware.graphics.allocator.IAllocator
